            {
              "_type": "UMLNoteView",
              "_id": "31bc74822a694200b375a83a62dd8c31",
              "name": "",
              "left": 80,
              "top": 1180,
              "width": 1210,
              "height": 70,
              "text": "上部：三级分类与求购；下部：订单 / 已购数据结构。订单实体存在不代表支付流程已实现。\nOrderForm.uid、BoughtShop.uid / sid、GoodsOfOrderForm.sid 指向图02的用户 / 商品。",
              "font": "Microsoft YaHei;12;0",
              "fillColor": "#fffbe8",
              "_parent": {
                "$ref": "95a36c2e73e54a3494685e2951bcfbe8"
              }
            }
          ],
          "_parent": {
            "$ref": "b332c47fc00748d9aa22c0fb41ab516d"
          },
          "documentation": "改进版：按职责分区；采用避让节点的正交连线；以源码为依据，分析假设见注释。"
        },
